---
/** Velocity module — velocity as consequence of standards, IA as practice. */
---

<section class="velocity" data-station="velocity" data-side="right" aria-labelledby="velocity-heading">
  <div class="velocity__container">
    <h2 class="velocity__title" id="velocity-heading" data-block>Velocity is a consequence of standards</h2>
    <div class="velocity__content">
      <p class="velocity__text" data-block>
        Fast teams aren't fast because they skip steps. They're fast because they don't have to 
        revisit decisions, explain context twice, or fix what was rushed the first time.
      </p>
      <p class="velocity__text" data-block>
        Our engineers use AI as a standard of practice — not a shortcut, but a multiplier 
        applied to work that was already rigorous. The foundation stays clean. The pace compounds.
      </p>
      <p class="velocity__accent" data-block>
        You don't hire us because we move fast. You hire us because what we build doesn't slow you down later.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
